.TH DANBY-WHITEDWARF 1
.SH NAME
danby-whitedwarf \- degenerate stellar profiles and limiting mass
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B temple/whitedwarf
.SH MODEL
Hydrostatic balance is closed by a degenerate equation of state. Moving gamma
toward 4/3 exposes the weak dependence of total mass on central density that
leads to the Chandrasekhar limiting-mass result.
.SH SOURCE
.B /appl/danby/whitedwarf.b
